title: "PoliMI Early-Stage BEM & Sustainability Studio: Integrated Building Energy Modeling, Climate Studio, Whole-Life Carbon LCA & Multi-Objective Architectural Optimization Platform"
abstract: "A browser-based, high-performance computational platform for early-stage architectural engineering, environmental design research, and building performance optimization. Integrates client-side EPW weather parsing, UTCI thermal comfort, 8,760h hourly energy balance, ISO 52000-1 / UNI-TS 11300 calculations, whole-life carbon LCA (EN 15978 / 5Rs), and Eurocode structural pre-dimensioning (EN 1990-1996)."
